SUMMARY:Panther's in the Know: Online Civic Trivia - Volunteer Edition
DESCRIPTION:April 19th - 25th\, 2026 is National Volunteer Week\, so this
  edition focuses on volunteering. Volunteering takes many forms and can b
 e at an individual or organizational level. Take our trivia challenge to 
 learn more and maybe find an opportunity to get involved today!By partici
 pating\, you will automatically be entered into a drawing to win one of f
 ive $25 Amazon gift cards. You can earn an extra entry by responding to o
 ur "Tell us what you think" prompt.Trivia entries are due by Saturday\, A
 pril 25thNote: PCC Employees are welcome to play\, however\, they are not
  eligible to win a giftcard per PCC policy. However\, we are happy to sen
 d you a Civic Leadership Development Prize Pack instead.—Event Details:
  https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382628 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382628)
