 ive $25 Amazon gift cards. You can earn an extra entry by responding to o
 ur "Tell us what you think" prompt.Trivia entries are due by Saturday\, A
 pril 25thNote: PCC Employees are welcome to play\, however\, they are not
  eligible to win a giftcard per PCC policy. However\, we are happy to sen
 d you a Civic Leadership Development Prize Pack instead.—Event Details:
