DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T140000
SUMMARY:Darning Sewing Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Come learn about Darning Sewing! Darning is a sewing techniqu
 e used to repair holes or worn areas in fabric\, particularly knitwear or
  socks\, by weaving new threads directly over the damaged area to create 
 a newish piece of fabric. It acts as a durable\, often near-invisible men
 d\, typically done by hand with a needle and thread or by using a sewing 
 machine to create a checkerboard pattern.
