DESCRIPTION:Dungeons and Dragons with the VRC provides a space for studen
 ts and veterans to socialize and have fun. Through socializing and partic
 ipating in the hobby of D&amp\;D participants can form meaningful friends
 hips over a common interest. The practice of D&amp\;D also develops parti
 cipants problem solving skills and social skills with added bonus of inco
 rporating basic math.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382798
  (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382798)
