SUMMARY:Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America - Documentary Screening
DESCRIPTION:All PCC students are invited to attend a free screening and d
 iscussion of award-winning filmmaker Jon Osaki's newest documentary\, Mak
 ing Waves: The Rise of Asian America. We will be joined by Jon Osaki\, an
 d students will have the opportunity for Q&amp\;A after the screening. Lu
 nch will be provided.Read the description below to learn more about the d
 ocumentary.–Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America explores the vital 
 role of ethnic studies in redefining the narrative and promoting service 
 to communities across the country. From the 1968 student strikes at UC Be
 rkeley and San Francisco State to present-day movements\, Making Waves do
 cuments the stories of Asian American activism and efforts to lift-up eth
 nic studies as a strategy to address present and future anti-Asian hate.W
 ATCH THE TRAILER: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE (https://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/r
 svp?id=382682 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382682)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:All PCC students are invited to attend a fre
 e screening and discussion of award-winning filmmaker Jon Osaki's newest 
 documentary\, Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America. We will be joined 
 by Jon Osaki\, and students will have the opportunity for Q&amp\;A after 
 the screening. Lunch will be provided.<br />Read the description below to
  learn more about the documentary.<br />–<br />Making Waves: The Rise o
 f Asian America explores the vital role of ethnic studies in redefining t
 he narrative and promoting service to communities across the country. Fro
 m the 1968 student strikes at UC Berkeley and San Francisco State to pres
 ent-day movements\, Making Waves documents the stories of Asian American 
 activism and efforts to lift-up ethnic studies as a strategy to address p
 resent and future anti-Asian hate.<br />WATCH THE TRAILER: <a href="https
 ://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE" target="_blank">https://www.youtu
 be.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE</a><br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="http
 s://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382682" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?
 id=382682</a>
