 ps in successfully securing a job. Whether yours needs to be built from s
 cratch or just needs a little fine-tuning\, Career Services is here to he
 lp with a resume-writing workshop.We'll discuss the components of a well-
 written modern resume and what information to include\, as well as how an
 d why you should customize your content.Plus\, we'll share common errors 
