 e components of a well-written modern résumé and what information to in
 clude\, as well as how and why you should customize your content.<br />Pl
 us\, we'll share common errors to avoid\, as well as tips and tricks to g
 ive you the best chance of rising to the top of the proverbial pile.<br /
 >To request an accommodation\, please contact cap@pcc.edu four days befor
 e the event.<br />Meeting Link: <a href="https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeti
