SUMMARY:Drop-In Brief Counseling for Students Balancing School & Recovery
DESCRIPTION:Students balancing school and any type of addiction and/or re
 covery are invited to drop in for a brief chat with a licensed counselor.
  These drop in sessions are available throughout the Fall term and studen
 ts are welcome to attend as often as is useful for them. No appointment n
 eeded\, just Zoom in during the open drop in hours for a brief\, confiden
 tial and private session.Meeting Link: Drop-In Brief Counseling for Stude
 nts Balancing School &amp\; Recovery—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu
 /rsvp?id=382577 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382577)
